{{!-- subject: 👤 Ticket #{{ticket.shortId}} assigned to {{agent.name}} --}}
<h2 style="margin:0 0 12px;color:#fff">An agent is on it</h2>
<p style="color:#cbd5e1">Hi {{user.name}}, <strong>{{agent.name}}</strong> from our IT Support team has been assigned to your ticket <em>{{ticket.subject}}</em>.</p>
<p style="color:#cbd5e1">They will reach out shortly with next steps.</p>
<p><a href="{{appUrl}}/dashboard" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6,#a855f7);color:#fff;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none">Open dashboard</a></p>
